window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-095-4257e825ba1e265c.json"]={sha256:"4257e825ba1e265cbd880b2b2a5948864f35fce7dff1af1c435aec00e8bc6726",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-e44c459f2966e90e","url":"https://velero.io/docs/v1.18/restore-reference/","title":"Velero restore reference","titleEn":"Velero restore reference","publisher":"Velero","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-095","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-095","related":[{"id":"security-v26-096","referenceUrls":["https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/continuous-archiving.html"],"title":"PostgreSQL PITR：基礎備份、WAL連續性與停止點","titleEn":"PostgreSQL PITR: base backup, WAL continuity and recovery targets","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付50物件報告、10卷驗證表、相依順序、應用一致性測試及回退方案。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver fifty object results, ten volume validations, dependency order, application-consistency tests and rollback plan.","difference":"驗證備份起點以來WAL連續性，選明確停止點並檢查應保留與應排除的交易。","differenceEn":"Verify WAL continuity from the backup start, choose an explicit target, and test transactions that must remain or be excluded.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["持久資料驗證率=通過內容檢查的卷/必需卷；所有YAML還原不表示卷資料也已恢復。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 50個資源物件都已還原，10個必要卷中8個通過假資料雜湊與應用讀取測試。 物件成功率100%，資料驗證率8/10=80%，服務尚不能宣稱完整恢復。","簡化復原時間=基礎備份還原時間+需重播WAL量/有效重播速率；真實時間另受I/O與檢查影響。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 假資料基礎備份還原90秒，需重播480MB WAL，有效40MB/秒。 重播12秒，簡化總時間90+12=102秒。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Persistent-data validation counts volumes passing content checks; restored YAML does not prove restored volume data. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. All fifty resource objects restore, but only eight of ten required volumes pass fake-data hash and application-read tests. Object success is 100%, while data validation is 80%; full service recovery is not yet established.","Simplified recovery time is base restore plus WAL volume divided by replay rate; real timing also includes I/O and validation. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. A fake-data base restore takes ninety seconds, followed by 480 MB of WAL at an effective 40 MB/s. Replay takes twelve seconds, giving a simplified total of 102 seconds.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-005","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6238.html"],"title":"TOTP：時間視窗、漂移與一次性驗證","titleEn":"TOTP: time windows, drift and one-time verification","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付50物件報告、10卷驗證表、相依順序、應用一致性測試及回退方案。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver fifty object results, ten volume validations, dependency order, application-consistency tests and rollback plan.","difference":"以測試用秘密和虛構時鐘畫出三十秒區間；將產生步數、允許漂移視窗、已使用狀態分開，勿使用真實帳戶的 TOTP seed。","differenceEn":"Use a test secret and fictional clock to draw 30-second intervals; separate generation step, allowed drift window and consumed state, using no real account seed.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["持久資料驗證率=通過內容檢查的卷/必需卷；所有YAML還原不表示卷資料也已恢復。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 50個資源物件都已還原，10個必要卷中8個通過假資料雜湊與應用讀取測試。 物件成功率100%，資料驗證率8/10=80%，服務尚不能宣稱完整恢復。","T=floor((t−T0)/X)；步數邊界是半開區間，放寬視窗增加可接受候選，並不消除線上速率限制與重播控制需求。 T0=0、X=30秒、t=95秒，整數時間不含網路延遲。 floor(95/30)=3；t改125秒時floor(125/30)=4。另需檢查t=119與120分屬步數3與4。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Persistent-data validation counts volumes passing content checks; restored YAML does not prove restored volume data. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. All fifty resource objects restore, but only eight of ten required volumes pass fake-data hash and application-read tests. Object success is 100%, while data validation is 80%; full service recovery is not yet established.","T=floor((t−T0)/X); intervals are half-open, and widening the window increases candidates without removing rate-limit or replay-control requirements. T0=0, X=30 seconds and t=95 seconds, using integer timestamps with no network delay. floor(95/30)=3; at t=125, floor(125/30)=4. Also verify that t=119 and 120 belong to steps 3 and 4.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-d8137edae9e4b659","url":"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/continuous-archiving.html","title":"PostgreSQL 18 continuous archiving and PITR","titleEn":"PostgreSQL 18 continuous archiving and PITR","publisher":"PostgreSQL Global Development Group","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-e2ac9301bc85f8f0","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6238.html","title":"RFC 6238: Time-Based One-Time Password Algorithm","titleEn":"RFC 6238: Time-Based One-Time Password Algorithm","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
